/**
 * Factory for creating {@link Document} instances using a SAX parser.
 *
 * <p>This implementation protects against XML External Entity (XXE) attacks by
 * explicitly disabling all forms of DTD processing and external entity resolution.
 * The parser is configured with the following security features:</p>
 *
 * <ul>
 *   <li>Disallow DOCTYPE declarations – {@code http://apache.org/xml/features/disallow-doctype-decl}</li>
 *   <li>Do not load external DTDs – {@code http://apache.org/xml/features/nonvalidating/load-external-dtd}</li>
